                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "Since this is actually not about the Sensor Value by the Sensor itseld, I wonder if this should be a separate interface (Sensor.Source), but you can wait for more reviews to make this change."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Sensor/Value.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 56,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Since there are several properties that essentially indicate which category a sensor belongs to, we can group those properties and put them into the separate interface (Sensor.Type). I have a proposal for that here - https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/81658. @patrick@stwcx.xyz what do you suggest we should keep `Implementation` property here or move it to `Sensor.Type`?"
                },
